WEBVTT

00:09:58.903 --> 00:10:01.841
začneme našimi frázami. A potom toto.

00:10:01.841 --> 00:10:03.530
Niečo vybudujeme, zorganizujeme to,

00:10:03.530 --> 00:10:05.179
frázy. Ideme. Pekne pomaly.

00:10:05.179 --> 00:10:08.581
Môžeme a ideme... um. (metronóm)

00:10:08.581 --> 00:10:12.977
(metronóm)

00:10:12.977 --> 00:10:16.661
Začína duet. (metronóm)

00:10:16.661 --> 00:10:29.987
(metronóm)

00:10:29.987 --> 00:10:33.424
Tak, OK, super. OK, dobre, veľmi dobre. (potlesk)